━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
Patch 1: patch1 ┃Patch 2: patch2
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Patch mode: comparisons use only
the source lines quoted in the
patches.

═════════════════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES          *
═════════════════════════════════
Signs mark edits made by only
that patch. A sign-less line with
one number is an edit both
patches make: a new number means
both add it, an old number means
both remove it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│foo.c  ┃ old new│foo.c
        │@@     ┃        │@@ x
   1   1│l01    ┃        │
-  2    │l02    ┃        │
+      2│P1TWO  ┃        │
   3   3│l03    ┃   3   3│l03
   4   4│l04    ┃   4   4│l04
   5   5│l05    ┃   5   5│l05
   6   6│LAST   ┃-  6    │LAST
\       │No newl┃\       │No newl
        │ine at ┃        │ine at
        │end of ┃        │end of
        │file   ┃        │file
        │       ┃+      6│NEWLAST
        │       ┃\       │No newl
        │       ┃        │ine at
        │       ┃        │end of
        │       ┃        │file

═════════════════════════════════
*    CONTEXT DIFFERENCES        *
═════════════════════════════════
Signs mark lines present in only
one result: - patch1, + patch2.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
     new│foo.c  ┃     new│foo.c
        │@@     ┃        │@@ x
       3│l03    ┃       3│l03
       4│l04    ┃       4│l04
       5│l05    ┃       5│l05
-      6│LAST   ┃+      6│NEWLAST
\       │No newl┃\       │No newl
        │ine at ┃        │ine at
        │end of ┃        │end of
        │file   ┃        │file
